=========================================================================
Web source : web/src/features/analytics/pages/StatisticsPage.tsx (route /statistics)
Output     : apps/windows/TeslaSync.App/feature-views/StatisticsPage/
             (repo convention = C#-markup feature-views, not Features/*.xaml; see sibling
              done pages QuickStatsPage/VehicleCostPage/TrueCostPage)
Nav        : apps/windows/TeslaSync.App/Shell/ShellWindow.xaml.cs — PageFactory.Register("Statistics", …)
             (RouteTable already maps Page("Statistics","statistics",RouteGroup.Analytics,"Statistics","\uE9D9"))
Strings    : apps/windows/Strings/{en,he,ar}/Resources.resw — 30 translation.statistics.* keys already
             present (catalog-generated); 2 added this prompt: statistics.stateDistribution.aria,
             statistics.vehicleComparison.aria (resolved by key).

Files:
  feature-views/StatisticsPage/StatisticsPage.Model.cs      (parsers + projection + registration + diagnostics + source port)
  feature-views/StatisticsPage/StatisticsPage.Source.cs     (generated C# client cache-then-network: vehicles+period+battery+mileage+states+fleet)
  feature-views/StatisticsPage/StatisticsPage.ViewModel.cs  (INotifyPropertyChanged 4-state holder + units/currency)
  feature-views/StatisticsPage/StatisticsPage.cs            (WinUI 3 UserControl, Fluent + design tokens)
  TeslaSync.App.Tests/FeatureViews/StatisticsPageTests.cs   (35 headless tests)
  TeslaSync.App.Tests/TeslaSync.App.Tests.csproj            (link the 3 UI-free files; the WinUI view is build-only)

Data sources (P1/S8 ObservableObject VM → generated C# client; web hook names kept at the C# call sites):
  statsQuery (period-stats)   -> StatisticsSource.FetchAsync step 2, ApiRequest("get_api_v1_analytics_period_stats", vehicle_id)  [PRIMARY → page state]
  useBatteryHealthAnalytics   -> StatisticsSource secondary, ApiRequest(Operations.Analytics.BatteryHealth, vehicle_id)
  useMileageStats             -> StatisticsSource secondary, ApiRequest("get_api_v1_mileage_stats", vehicle_id)
  useStateSummary             -> StatisticsSource secondary, ApiRequest("get_api_v1_vehicle_states_summary", vehicle_id)
  useFleetAnalytics(30,start)  -> StatisticsSource secondary, ApiRequest(Operations.Analytics.Fleet, start=today-1y)
  (primary vehicle resolved from GET /vehicles[0]; secondary reads fault-tolerant via TryReadAsync → ApiException ⇒ section empty state.)
Units (P1/S5): SI read from the API; converted only at the display boundary in StatisticsProjection via
  UnitConverters.DistanceFromSi + the Wh/km→Wh/mi rescale + ScalarFormatters (no non-SI stored/computed).
Live data: none (web page uses TanStack-Query hooks, no useLiveX/SSE), so no SSE subscription / staleness chip (ADR-013 n/a).

